    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im working on updating our company handbook for the new year and im stuck on the section about pronouns. some people want us to mandate gender-neutral pronouns to be more inclusive, but others in the office are saying it's confusing and feels like we're forcing a specific ideology on everyone. can u give me a summary of the pros and cons so i can decide how to write this?",
